  "description": "The app's original hand-rolled icon set: Unicode glyphs plus two drawn shapes (play/pause, kind 'builtin'). Kept as an opt-in pack so the pre-Material look stays available. Glyphs resolve against whatever system font supplies the codepoint, so rendering varies by machine — that fragility is inherent to the set, and is why `material` is the default.",
